OL,3,GNEWSAI almost died after a toothache
OL,4,Aled to sepsis and a rare heart
OL,5,Acondition
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhat seemed like a simple case of
OL,8,Ftoothache led to a rare heart
OL,9,Fcondition, sepsis and doctors believing
OL,10,FDanny Ellis had just a 1% chance of
OL,11,Fsurvival.
OL,13,FThe 42-year-old from Llanrwst in Conwy
OL,14,Fcounty began experiencing tooth pain in
OL,15,FApril, and went to the dentist where he
OL,16,Fwas given antibiotics.
OL,18,FBut the pain kept returning and it was
OL,19,Fnot until he was left with red marks on
OL,20,Fhis body that he was finally rushed to
OL,21,Fhospital.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
